---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import Email from '../../components/Email.astro';
import { SITE, LEGAL_PATHS, withBase } from '../../site';
---
<Legal
  page="support"
  lang="en"
  title={`${SITE.name} help`}
  shortTitle="Help"
  description={`Quick answers about ${SITE.name} and how to reach us if something isn't working.`}
>
  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Email us at <Email lang="en" />. Tell us what happened, which phone you use and the app version. We reply on business
    days.
  </p>

  <h2 id="faq">Frequently asked questions</h2>

  <h3>Do I need an account?</h3>
  <p>
    No. You can use the app as a guest and everything stays on your phone. You only need an account to share groups or
    recurring expenses with other people.
  </p>

  <h3>Where is my data?</h3>
  <p>
    Your transactions, accounts and categories are only on your phone. What you share is stored on our servers to sync it
    with the other members. The details are in the <a href={withBase(LEGAL_PATHS.privacy.en)}>Privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>I changed phones. How do I get my data back?</h3>
  <p>
    What you shared comes back when you sign in with the same account. What you didn't share can only be recovered if it was
    in a backup of your phone (iCloud or Google) and you restore it on the new one. Purchases come back with the restore
    purchases option and the same store account.
  </p>

  <h3>How do I join a group or a recurring expense?</h3>
  <p>
    Ask whoever created it for the invite code. In the app, choose to join with a code, sign in and type it. Codes expire,
    so if it doesn't work, ask for a new one.
  </p>

  <h3>My group's admin deleted their account. What now?</h3>
  <p>
    The group keeps working. Open it and tap “Take over as admin”: the first person to do it becomes the admin. If it was a
    shared recurring expense, it ended and was archived; to keep splitting it, create a new one.
  </p>

  <h3>Does the app move money or connect to my bank?</h3>
  <p>No. It only records what you enter. Payments between people happen outside the app.</p>

  <h3>How do I get a refund?</h3>
  <p>
    Purchases are charged by Apple or Google, so refunds are requested from the store where you bought. If something is
    wrong with what you bought, email us anyway and we'll help.
  </p>

  <h3>I'm not getting reminders</h3>
  <p>
    Check that notifications for {SITE.name} are allowed in your phone's settings. On Android, also check that battery saver
    isn't holding the app back.
  </p>

  <h3>How do I delete my account?</h3>
  <p>In the app, go to Profile › Account › Delete account. More in <a href={withBase(LEGAL_PATHS.deleteAccount.en)}>Delete your account</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="legal">Legal</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={withBase(LEGAL_PATHS.privacy.en)}>Privacy policy</a></li>
    <li><a href={withBase(LEGAL_PATHS.terms.en)}>Terms of use</a></li>
    <li><a href={withBase(LEGAL_PATHS.deleteAccount.en)}>Delete your account</a></li>
  </ul>
</Legal>
